  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이번에 지능형 과학실 사업때문에</p><p>과학실 블라인드를 바꿔보려고 발품팔다가</p><p>제미나이에게 기환생과 과학사 내용을 녹여 만든 기안으로 만든 블라인드 이미지를 공유드립니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>사이즈는 160*200으로 제작되었습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1ef38d29ef448350c2df9c40f9c955489593b622?download\" data-file-name=\"과학 블라인드 (160 x 200 mm).pptx\" data-file-size=\"9749361\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfL6Q%26dataid%3D12%26fileid%3D13%26regdt%3D20260620234349&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F1ef38d29ef448350c2df9c40f9c955489593b622')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">과학 블라인드 (160 x 200 mm)</span><span class=\"type\">.pptx</span></div><div class=\"size\">9.30MB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dcb316241f85f8dab83562c80c942cd37b78df4a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dcb316241f85f8dab83562c80c942cd37b78df4a\" data-origin-width=\"1600\" data-origin-height=\"2000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/61ea12371cbf8716a89fb6f1bda6557d3aaf0e69\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/61ea12371cbf8716a89fb6f1bda6557d3aaf0e69\" data-origin-width=\"1600\" data-origin-height=\"2000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f6681de8a66d7de197492c3cdea29daec4040d59\" class=\"txc-imag